<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>BMIR | Bharat Multisector Innovation & Research</title><style> *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:16px/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif;color:#183047;background:#f4f7fa}header{background:#09263e;color:white;padding:18px 6%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}a{color:inherit}nav{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}nav a{text-decoration:none}button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid #9ab5c6;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 16px;background:white;color:#12334b;font:inherit}.hero{background:linear-gradient(125deg,#09263e,#155b70);color:white;padding:70px 6%}h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px);line-height:1.15;max-width:850px;margin:16px 0}h2{font-size:28px;line-height:1.3}section{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:32px 6%}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:16px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #dce5eb;border-radius:14px;padding:22px}.tag{font-size:13px;color:#386477}.cta{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#12334b;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}footer{background:#09263e;color:white;padding:30px 6%}input{padding:12px;width:100%;max-width:500px;border:1px solid #a8bac6;border-radius:8px;font:inherit}small{color:#536a7b}.detail-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;color:#155b70;font-weight:700}.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:14px} [hidden]{display:none!important} </style><header><strong>BMIR</strong><nav><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="portfolio.html">Portfolio</a><a href="projects.html">Projects</a><a href="patent-summary.html">Patent publications</a><a href="collaboration.html">Collaboration</a><a href="#about" data-en="About" data-hi="परिचय">About</a><a href="#portfolio" data-en="Innovations" data-hi="आविष्कार">Innovations</a><a href="#ip" data-en="Patents" data-hi="पेटेंट">Patents</a><a href="#contact" data-en="Contact" data-hi="संपर्क">Contact</a></nav><button id="lang">हिंदी</button> <a href="programme.html">समेकित कार्यक्रम / Integrated Programme</a></header><div class="hero"><div>RESEARCH • ENGINEERING • PUBLIC IMPACT</div><h1>Bharat Multisector Innovation & Research</h1><p data-en="Innovation for a Better India — independent research and technology concepts for real-world challenges." data-hi="बेहतर भारत के लिए नवाचार — वास्तविक समस्याओं के समाधान हेतु स्वतंत्र अनुसंधान और तकनीकी अवधारणाएं।">Innovation for a Better India — independent research and technology concepts for real-world challenges.</p><p>Binod Pandey · Independent Inventor · Bhagalpur, Bihar</p><a class="cta" href="#portfolio" data-en="Explore innovations" data-hi="आविष्कार देखें">Explore innovations</a><div class="grid" style="margin-top:28px;max-width:900px"><div style="border:1px solid #7fa6b7;border-radius:12px;padding:16px"><strong style="font-size:30px">27</strong><div>Innovations & projects</div></div><div style="border:1px solid #7fa6b7;border-radius:12px;padding:16px"><strong style="font-size:30px">17</strong><div>Patent application records</div></div><div style="border:1px solid #7fa6b7;border-radius:12px;padding:16px"><strong style="font-size:30px">3</strong><div>Journal publications</div></div><div style="border:1px solid #7fa6b7;border-radius:12px;padding:16px"><strong style="font-size:30px">15</strong><div>Patent-filed innovations</div></div></div></div><section id="about"><h2 data-en="About BMIR" data-hi="BMIR का परिचय">About BMIR</h2><p data-en="BMIR is a proposed research and innovation initiative led by independent inventor Binod Pandey, focused on agriculture, healthcare, infrastructure and public-interest technology. We seek technical review, prototype development and evidence-based validation with suitable institutions." data-hi="BMIR स्वतंत्र आविष्कारक बिनोद पांडे की प्रस्तावित अनुसंधान एवं नवाचार पहल है। कृषि, स्वास्थ्य, बुनियादी ढांचे और जनहित तकनीक पर केंद्रित यह पहल उपयुक्त संस्थानों के साथ तकनीकी समीक्षा, प्रोटोटाइप विकास और वैज्ञानिक सत्यापन चाहती है।">BMIR is a proposed research and innovation initiative led by independent inventor Binod Pandey, focused on agriculture, healthcare, infrastructure and public-interest technology. We seek technical review, prototype development and evidence-based validation with suitable institutions.</p></section><section><h2>Research & collaboration / अनुसंधान एवं सहयोग</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h3>Published applications</h3><p>Three patent journal publications, with publication evidence. Publication is not grant.</p><a href="patent-summary.html">View publication records</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Institutional engagement</h3><p>Technical review, validation and pilot proposals; no partnership is implied by correspondence.</p><a href="collaboration.html">Explore collaboration</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Social impact</h3><p>ग्राम उदय एवं भविष्य निर्माण सहित समेकित कार्यक्रम।</p><a href="programme.html">Integrated programme</a></article></div></section><section id="portfolio"><h2 data-en="Innovation portfolio" data-hi="आविष्कार पोर्टफोलियो">Innovation portfolio</h2><input id="search" placeholder="Search innovations / आविष्कार खोजें"><select id="sector" aria-label="Sector filter" style="padding:12px;margin:10px 0;border-radius:8px;max-width:100%"></select><p id="count" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="cards" class="grid" style="margin-top:18px"></div></section><section id="detail" hidden></section><section id="ip"><h2 data-en="Intellectual property" data-hi="बौद्धिक संपदा">Intellectual property</h2><p data-en="Selected inventor-reported Indian patent application references. Filing does not mean a patent has been granted. Official status must be independently verified." data-hi="आविष्कारक द्वारा उपलब्ध कराई गई चयनित भारतीय पेटेंट आवेदन संख्याएं। आवेदन दाखिल होना पेटेंट स्वीकृति नहीं है। आधिकारिक स्थिति का स्वतंत्र सत्यापन आवश्यक है।">Selected inventor-reported Indian patent application references. Filing does not mean a patent has been granted. Official status must be independently verified.</p><div class="grid" id="patents"></div></section><section id="contact"><h2 data-en="Research collaboration" data-hi="अनुसंधान सहयोग">Research collaboration</h2><p data-en="Universities, laboratories and incubators are invited to discuss technical feasibility, prototype development and validation. No institutional partnership or approval is implied." data-hi="विश्वविद्यालयों, प्रयोगशालाओं और इनक्यूबेटरों को तकनीकी व्यवहार्यता, प्रोटोटाइप विकास और सत्यापन पर चर्चा के लिए आमंत्रण। किसी संस्थागत साझेदारी या अनुमोदन का दावा नहीं है।">Universities, laboratories and incubators are invited to discuss technical feasibility, prototype development and validation. No institutional partnership or approval is implied.</p><p>Binod Pandey · Bhagalpur, Bihar, India</p><p><a href="tel:+918340328914">+91 8340 328914</a></p></section><footer>BMIR · WEB-02 · Independent innovation initiative · 2026<br><small style="color:#c2d6e2">Concept-stage portfolio. Confidential technical details are intentionally excluded.</small></footer><section><h2>Published Patent Applications / प्रकाशित आवेदन</h2><div id="published"></div><small>Three publications evidenced by journal screenshots. Hydrogen & Oxygen Production System: provisional filed; publication not evidenced. Not a grant.</small></section><script>const data=[["KRISHI-BODH ONE", "Agriculture", "Plot-specific soil and crop decision support.", "खेत विशेष की मिट्टी और फसल निर्णय सहायता।", "", "Limited plot-specific soil advice", "Soil-sensing rover and crop suitability recommendations including flood exposure", "Compare sensor results with reference laboratory tests; validate crop advice locally", "Soil science and agricultural engineering labs", "खेत विशेष की मिट्टी संबंधी सलाह की कमी", "मिट्टी जांच रोवर और बाढ़ जोखिम सहित फसल उपयुक्तता सलाह", "प्रयोगशाला से तुलना और स्थानीय फसल सलाह का परीक्षण", "मृदा विज्ञान एवं कृषि इंजीनियरिंग संस्थान", "Not filed / unverified"], ["AGRI-SENTINEL", "Agriculture", "Drone-assisted crop monitoring and targeted intervention concept.", "ड्रोन आधारित फसल निगरानी।", "202631084588", "Delayed detection of crop stress", "Drone mapping and targeted intervention planning", "Ground-truth disease maps and assess treatment accuracy", "Crop protection and drone research teams", "फसल तनाव की देर से पहचान", "ड्रोन मानचित्रण और लक्षित उपचार योजना", "मैदानी रोग सत्यापन एवं उपचार सटीकता परीक्षण", "फसल संरक्षण एवं ड्रोन शोध दल", "Provisional"], ["MAKHANA-ROVER", "Agriculture", "Mechanisation concept for makhana cultivation.", "मखाना खेती के लिए यंत्रीकरण अवधारणा।", "202631107125", "Labour-intensive makhana cultivation", "Rover-assisted cultivation operations", "Assess mobility and crop damage in representative ponds", "Makhana research and farm machinery institutes", "मखाना खेती में अधिक श्रम", "रोवर आधारित खेती संचालन", "तालाब में गतिशीलता और फसल क्षति परीक्षण", "मखाना शोध एवं कृषि मशीनरी संस्थान", "Provisional"], ["Maize Cob Harvesting", "Agriculture", "Concept to reduce maize cob harvesting losses.", "मक्का भुट्टा कटाई में नुकसान घटाने की अवधारणा।", "202631049814", "Cob losses during harvest", "Mechanised cob collection with loss-reduction design goal", "Measure field losses, throughput and tractor compatibility", "Agricultural machinery engineering labs", "कटाई में भुट्टों का नुकसान", "नुकसान घटाने हेतु यांत्रिक भुट्टा संग्रह", "मैदानी नुकसान, क्षमता और ट्रैक्टर अनुकूलता परीक्षण", "कृषि मशीनरी इंजीनियरिंग प्रयोगशालाएं", "Provisional"], ["Intelligent Maize Dryer", "Agriculture", "Controlled maize grain drying concept.", "मक्का दानों को नियंत्रित ढंग से सुखाने की अवधारणा।", "202631058488", "Uneven drying and grain quality losses", "Controlled grain drying with monitoring", "Measure moisture uniformity, energy use and grain quality", "Post-harvest engineering laboratories", "असमान सुखाई औ